data_zrte5
# Phase identity: room-temperature orthorhombic ZrTe5, Cmcm, Z=4.
# Open basis source: Facio et al., SciPost Phys. 14, 066 (2023), Table 1
# structure B (CC BY 4.0), doi:10.21468/SciPostPhys.14.4.066. The table
# reproduces the 293 K Fjellvag-Kjekshus refinement (ICSD 85506); this file was
# constructed from the open table, not redistributed from proprietary ICSD.
# The reported 4c/8f sites are expanded explicitly in P1 in the standard Cmcm
# setting. Layers lie in a-c and stack along b; C centering extinguishes (010).
# The catalog B_ang2=0.6 A^2 is a modeling placeholder, not source-derived.
# Limiting checks: V=abc, Zr4Te20, extinct (010), finite (020).
# Validation: zrte5-cmcm-structure
